SWI-Prolog
https://github.com/SWI-Prolog/swipl-devel
=====================================================================================================

LogicKernel is a PORT of SWI-Prolog to Julia, and so a derivative work of it. Its source files
under src/ and boot/ and its ported tests under test/ are translated, file by file, from
SWI-Prolog's C and Prolog sources (the swipl-devel repository above); they keep upstream's paths,
names and logic. SWI-Prolog is the work of Jan Wielemaker and its contributors.

SWI-Prolog's copyright notice, as its source files carry it:

    Copyright (c)  1985-2026, University of Amsterdam
                              VU University Amsterdam
                              CWI, Amsterdam
                              SWI-Prolog Solutions b.v.
    All rights reserved.

The years and the holders differ from file to file. Every ported file therefore reproduces, in its
header, the upstream file it was ported from, the upstream commit it was read at, and that upstream
file's own copyright lines VERBATIM (`# UPSTREAM:`, `# COPYRIGHT:`); tools/port_check.jl fails the
test suite when a ported file lacks them or when a line is not upstream's. docs/port_inventory.md
lists every ported file.

